 "remarks": "A truly exceptional private estate, this country compound set on more than three private acres, blends timeless character, refined design, and modern luxury. Anchored by a beautifully preserved 1932 main residence and an extraordinary 2,300-square-foot poolside entertainment barn, the property is designed for both everyday living and effortless entertaining. The main residence offers five bedrooms and three full baths, including a luxurious primary suite with spa-like bath, expansive walk-in closet, and private deck overlooking the grounds. Gracious formal living and dining rooms complement a chef's kitchen opening to the family room and breakfast area. A finished lower level provides additional living and entertaining space. The poolside barn is a destination unto itself, with a dramatic Great room, wet bar and kitchenette, private gym, home office, full bath, and outdoor shower. Expansive lawns, perennial gardens, multiple outdoor fireplaces, a spectacular swimming pool, and gracious dining veranda complete the grounds. Distinct living and entertaining spaces flow effortlessly together, creating an experience like no other.",
